<template><main class="kit-page"><section class="kit-hero"><div class="page-shell"><div><p class="eyebrow">CURATED KIT COLLECTION</p><h1>향기로운 일상을 위한<br />카리나벨 키트</h1><p>처음 시작하는 분도, 소중한 사람을 위한 선물도.<br />엄선된 에센셜 오일을 하나의 키트로 만나보세요.</p><a href="#kit-catalog">키트 둘러보기 <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-down"></i></a></div><div class="kit-hero-art"><img src="/products/프랑킨센스.png" alt="프랑킨센스 오일" /><img src="/products/라벤더.png" alt="라벤더 오일" /><span>CURATED<br />WITH CARE</span></div></div></section><section id="kit-catalog" class="kit-catalog page-shell"><div class="kit-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">KIT COLLECTION</p><h2>나에게 맞는 키트를 찾아보세요.</h2></div><div class="kit-tools"><label><i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass"></i><input v-model.trim="keyword" type="search" placeholder="키트명 검색" /></label><select v-model="sort"><option value="recommended">추천순</option><option value="low">낮은 가격순</option><option value="high">높은 가격순</option></select></div></div><div class="kit-count">총 <strong>{{filteredKits.length}}</strong>개의 키트</div><div v-if="isLoading" class="kit-grid"><div v-for="n in 4" :key="n" class="kit-skeleton"><span></span><i></i><i></i></div></div><div v-else-if="loadError" class="community-empty"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-exclamation"></i><h2>키트 상품을 불러오지 못했습니다.</h2><p>잠시 후 다시 시도해 주세요.</p><button @click="loadKits">다시 불러오기</button></div><div v-else-if="filteredKits.length" class="kit-grid"><article v-for="(kit,index) in filteredKits" :key="kit._id" @click="goDetail(kit._id)"><div class="kit-image"><span v-if="index===0" class="kit-badge">BEST KIT</span><img :src="kit.imagePath||'/img/defalut_product.png'" :alt="kit.kitName" loading="lazy" /><button>키트 자세히 보기 <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></button></div><div class="kit-copy"><p>KARINABEL CURATED KIT</p><h3>{{kit.kitName}}</h3><span class="kit-components">에센셜 오일 {{kit.products?.length||0}}종 구성</span><div><strong>{{formatPrice(kit.memberPrice)}}원</strong><del v-if="kit.originalPrice&&kit.originalPrice!==kit.memberPrice">{{formatPrice(kit.originalPrice)}}원</del><em v-if="discountRate(kit)">{{discountRate(kit)}}% OFF</em></div></div></article></div><div v-else class="community-empty"><i class="fa-solid fa-box-open"></i><h2>검색 결과가 없습니다.</h2><p>다른 키트명으로 검색해 보세요.</p><button @click="keyword=''">전체 키트 보기</button></div></section><section class="kit-benefit"><div class="page-shell"><article><i class="fa-solid fa-wand-magic-sparkles"></i><h3>엄선된 구성</h3><p>함께 사용하기 좋은 오일을 세심하게 구성했습니다.</p></article><article><i class="fa-solid fa-gift"></i><h3>특별한 선물</h3><p>소중한 사람에게 향기로운 순간을 선물하세요.</p></article><article><i class="fa-solid fa-tag"></i><h3>키트 전용 혜택</h3><p>개별 구매보다 합리적인 회원가로 만나보세요.</p></article></div></section></main></template>
<script setup>import{computed,onMounted,ref}from"vue";import{useRouter}from"vue-router";import ProductService from"@/api/ProductService.js";const router=useRouter(),kits=ref([]),keyword=ref(""),sort=ref("recommended"),isLoading=ref(true),loadError=ref(false);const filteredKits=computed(()=>{let list=kits.value.filter(kit=>(kit.kitName||"").toLowerCase().includes(keyword.value.toLowerCase()));if(sort.value==="low")list=[...list].sort((a,b)=>(a.memberPrice||0)-(b.memberPrice||0));if(sort.value==="high")list=[...list].sort((a,b)=>(b.memberPrice||0)-(a.memberPrice||0));return list});const loadKits=async()=>{isLoading.value=true;loadError.value=false;try{const response=await ProductService.getKits(localStorage.getItem("token"));kits.value=Array.isArray(response.data)?response.data:[]}catch(error){console.error(error);loadError.value=true;kits.value=[]}finally{isLoading.value=false}};const formatPrice=value=>Number(value||0).toLocaleString("ko-KR");const discountRate=kit=>kit.originalPrice>kit.memberPrice?Math.round((1-kit.memberPrice/kit.originalPrice)*100):0;const goDetail=id=>router.push({name:"KitDetail",params:{id}});onMounted(loadKits);</script>
<style>.kit-page{background:#fff}.kit-hero{overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#f4edeb,#faf8f5)}.kit-hero>.page-shell{min-height:570px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;align-items:center}.kit-hero h1{margin:15px 0 20px;font-family:Georgia,"Noto Serif KR",serif;font-size:clamp(2.7rem,4.6vw,4.5rem);font-weight:400;line-height:1.25}.kit-hero>div>div:first-child>p:not(.eyebrow){color:#756b70;font-size:.84rem;line-height:1.9}.kit-hero a{display:inline-block;margin-top:30px;padding:13px 20px;color:#fff;background:var(--color-brand-dark);font-size:.72rem}.kit-hero a i{margin-left:20px}.kit-hero-art{position:relative;height:100%;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:center}.kit-hero-art img{position:absolute;bottom:20px;width:52%;height:82%;object-fit:contain;filter:drop-shadow(0 25px 24px rgba(47,29,38,.16))}.kit-hero-art img:first-child{left:8%;transform:rotate(-6deg)}.kit-hero-art img:nth-child(2){right:4%;transform:rotate(7deg)}.kit-hero-art span{position:absolute;top:55px;right:0;color:#c3afb5;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:1rem;letter-spacing:.12em}.kit-catalog{padding-block:100px 125px}.kit-heading{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:30px;padding-bottom:25px;border-bottom:1px solid #302a2d}.kit-heading h2{margin-top:8px;font-family:Georgia,"Noto Serif KR",serif;font-size:clamp(1.8rem,3vw,2.7rem);font-weight:400}.kit-tools{display:flex;gap:9px}.kit-tools label{width:190px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #aaa}.kit-tools input{width:100%;border:0;outline:0;font-size:.7rem}.kit-tools select{padding:0 30px 0 12px;border:1px solid var(--color-line);background:#fff;font-size:.68rem}.kit-count{margin:22px 0 18px;color:#968c91;font-size:.68rem}.kit-count strong{color:var(--color-brand)}.kit-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:50px 24px}.kit-image{position:relative;aspect-ratio:1/1.03;overflow:hidden;background:#f7f4f1}.kit-image img{width:100%;height:100%;padding:18px;object-fit:contain;transition:.5s}.kit-grid article{cursor:pointer}.kit-grid article:hover .kit-image img{transform:scale(1.04)}.kit-image button{position:absolute;right:12px;bottom:12px;left:12px;padding:12px;border:0;color:#fff;background:#3a3035e8;font-size:.68rem;opacity:0;transform:translateY(8px);transition:.2s}.kit-grid article:hover .kit-image button{opacity:1;transform:none}.kit-badge{position:absolute;top:13px;left:13px;z-index:2;padding:5px 8px;color:#fff;background:var(--color-brand);font-size:.55rem;font-weight:800}.kit-copy{padding-top:17px}.kit-copy>p{color:#a0959a;font-size:.57rem;letter-spacing:.09em}.kit-copy h3{margin-top:3px;font-size:1rem}.kit-components{display:block;margin-top:6px;color:#93898e;font-size:.66rem}.kit-copy>div{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:13px}.kit-copy strong{font-size:.9rem}.kit-copy del{color:#aaa;font-size:.67rem}.kit-copy em{margin-left:auto;color:#a3636e;font-size:.58rem;font-style:normal;font-weight:800}.kit-benefit{padding:65px 0;background:#30292d;color:#fff}.kit-benefit>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}.kit-benefit article{padding:10px 40px;border-right:1px solid #51464b}.kit-benefit article:last-child{border:0}.kit-benefit i{color:#d0a3ab}.kit-benefit h3{margin:10px 0 3px;font-size:.8rem}.kit-benefit p{color:#aaa0a5;font-size:.64rem}.kit-skeleton span{display:block;aspect-ratio:1;background:#f3f0ed}.kit-skeleton i{display:block;width:60%;height:11px;margin-top:13px;background:#f3f0ed}@media(max-width:850px){.kit-hero>.page-shell{grid-template-columns:1fr;min-height:760px;padding-top:65px}.kit-hero-art{min-height:380px}.kit-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}@media(max-width:600px){.kit-heading{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.kit-tools{width:100%;flex-direction:column}.kit-tools label,.kit-tools select{width:100%;height:40px}.kit-grid{gap:35px 12px}.kit-image button{display:none}.kit-copy h3{font-size:.88rem}.kit-copy>div{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column;gap:2px}.kit-copy em{margin-left:0}.kit-benefit>div{grid-template-columns:1fr}.kit-benefit article{padding:22px 5px;border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid #51464b}}
</style>
